          "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 / SteamOS (with extra cozy burrows)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Something faster than a bunny sprint - Intel Core i5+ or AMD equivalent.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A GPU strong enough to draw extra fluffy clouds and shinier carrots<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Required to fully enjoy the symphony of bunniverse souds<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> arning: prolonged play may make you start wiggling your nose</li></ul>"
